1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,380
Today is the first workday of the new year, and we'd like to start off with a very positive resolution, especially as we have twenty new staff members beginning today.

2
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:13,600
Our company has always been heavily involved in volunteer work.

3
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:18,800
We have several teams of volunteers, each of which specializes in a different area.

4
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:23,120
Please join one of the clubs and participate in their special activities.

5
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:29,540
We'd like all members to remember that service to others can be surprisingly fun and rewarding.

6
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:39,020
Our receptionist, Jo Workman, who is also the leader of the environmental action team, has prepared a handbook on volunteering and other social activities.

7
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:42,500
Please get a copy, and don't hesitate to join.
